Original bug 13: Fire Bullets converts a player's shot while either player's timer runs. The fix converts it only on
its shooter's timer: current_player_index, which the player updates set and a Nuke sets to its picker. 1.9.8, which
keeps the shot and adds a Fire Bullets shot before it, adds that shot for the listed owners on either player's timer;
the fix adds it for any player's shot on the shooter's timer, as it converts.
